          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akazinduka omurukyakya, yahika bwango ha bwingira bw'entale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu yairiire haihi obwingira Daneeri obwakaba arumu, obujune buraaliire kumwita, yairiza omunwa ha ibaale yayamirra ati: “Iwe Daneeri omuheereza wa Ruhanga omwomeezi, Ruhanga wawe ou oheereza obutoosa, asoboire kukujuna entale?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daneeri yagarukamu ati: “Hangiriza, Rukirabaisaija Omukama! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "TOB.4.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tob 4:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "TOB.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "TOB.12.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga wange atumirege malaika we, yaziigara akanwa, tizinkwasireho; habwokuba nkaba ntaina kabi hali Ruhanga wange kandi na iwe mwebingwa, tinkakusobezaaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama yasemererwa muno muno, yaragira baihe Daneeri omu bwingira Daneeri nukwo kwihwa omu bwingira, atakozirweho kabi n'akatoito kati habwokuba akaba ayesigire Ruhanga we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo omukama yaragira bakwate abantu bali abakaba banyegeriire Daneeri, babanage omu bwingira bw'entale, hamu na bakazi baabo n'abaana baabo; obu bakaba batakahikire hansi omu bwingira, entale zaabaanuukura, zaabahendahenda amagufa goona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
